## Absolute forbidden (do not “simplify” or “optimize”)

1. **Re-enable** `TransformSystemGroup` / Burst `LocalToWorldSystem` after late-join Instantiates while in-game.
2. **CreateEntity-cap + requeue** leftovers in GhostSpawn (ghost-map hole → baseline → Burst Crash!!!).
3. Raise delayed Instantiates above **1/frame**.
4. Re-enable any `MarkFromQuery` / visualizer mark that **`ToEntityArray`s all** asteroids/planets. Windows visuals come from baked Pending **or** the Instantiates hook SpawnRequest — never a full asteroid scan.
5. Add or restore client map-body **full scans** (`ToEntityArray` / `WithEntityAccess` / broad `foreach` / `ToComponentDataArray` over Asteroid/Planet/Gem) gated only by:
   ```csharp
   if (ClientJoinSettleCache.Settling) return; // FORBIDDEN as the only gate
   ```
6. Clear or ignore `TransformQuarantine` mid-session to “get Entities Graphics / minimap working.”
7. Use asteroid `CalculateEntityCount` / `ToEntityArray` to dismiss the loading screen while quarantined.
8. Edit only Package Cache NetCode — patch lives in **git** `Packages/com.unity.netcode` + `tools/netcode-patches/`.
9. Distance importance `TileSizeWorld` ≥ map size (use **~48**, not 512).
10. **Starve-escape / early-complete loading when `MapLoadingProxyCount == 0`** (or ≪ meta N). That opens Join Team with no map GOs → TeamChoice Crash!!! (2026-07-19).
11. Ship `WithEntityAccess` / `EnsureShipProxies` / local-ship tagging while `GhostSpawnBacklog` is true — Settling stays OFF after `JoinSettleCompleted`, but ship Instantiates still Crash!!! (2026-07-19).

